-- Removes Blizzard's internal test items from the world database: "Test ...", "QA Test ...", "[PH]", test gear
-- boxes and the like, found by the word "test" (or "QA") in their name. Real items that merely contain the
-- letters (Hatestrike, Flame-Tested Chestguard, Untested ... Sample, Slatesteel ...) are not matched, and
-- High Test Eternium Fishing Line (19971) is a real item kept on purpose. No character owns any of these.
-- The loot rows that pointed at them go too, so no loot table names a missing item.

